
# Numeric range: from start (inclusive) to end (exclusive) by step.

form range
  link start, like number
  link end, like number
  link step, like number

  task length
    take self
    like number
    send back
      call divide
        call subtract
          read self/end
          read self/start
        read self/step

  task contains
    take self
    take value, like number
    like boolean
    send back
      call and
        call is-minimum
          read value
          read self/start
        call is-below
          read value
          read self/end

  task to-list
    take self
    like list
    save out
      make list
    save at, read self/start
    walk test
      hook test
        call is-below
          read at
          read self/end
      hook step
        call out/push
          read at
        save at
          call add
            read at
            read self/step
    send back, read out
